## 11. No-WiFi screen never appears when page already loaded

**Symptom:** Turning off internet while a page is loaded just freezes the site;
no offline screen.

**Cause:** no WebView request is in flight, so `onReceivedError` never fires;
a capability-filtered `registerNetworkCallback` may not emit `onLost`.

**Fix:** two layers —
1. `registerDefaultNetworkCallback` with `onLost`/`onUnavailable` → emit false.
2. A heartbeat coroutine in the WebView screen: every ~4s check
   `isConnected()`; if false → go offline. Guard against double-navigation.

---

## 12. target="_blank" opens a slow external Chrome Custom Tab

**Symptom:** Some links take ~20s (cold Chrome launch) and open outside the app.

**Cause:** `target="_blank"` / `window.open` aren't handled → Android routes them
to an external browser. Also `shouldOverrideUrlLoading` sent non-`http` schemes
externally too eagerly.

**Fix:** leave `setSupportMultipleWindows(false)` (the default). The WebView
then opens `target="_blank"` in place and no external tab is involved.

**Do NOT** enable multiple windows and hand `onCreateWindow` the same WebView
as the transport — see #21, it crashes.

For scheme routing, whitelist the web schemes and externalize everything else
(#22), not the other way round.

---

## 13. Mixed content blocked

**Symptom:** Partner site assets (http on https page) don't load.

**Fix:** `settings.mixedContentMode = MIXED_CONTENT_ALWAYS_ALLOW` and a
`network_security_config.xml` with `cleartextTrafficPermitted="true"`.

---

## 14. Loading bar fills before the app is ready; dots freeze

**Symptom:** The splash progress bar reaches 100% before routing finishes; the
"Loading..." dots stop animating.

**Cause:** bar tied to a fixed `durationMs` timer; on completion the draw loop
`return`s and stops invalidating.

**Fix:** add an **indeterminate** mode for the routing splash — ease the bar
toward ~92% (never 100%) with a moving shimmer, keep posting frames so the dots
keep animating; navigate only when routing actually completes.

---

## 15. PNG in res/drawable* fails AAPT compile

**Symptom:** `AAPT: error: file failed to compile` on a screen-art PNG.

**Cause:** PNG with an ICC profile / non-standard chunks AAPT can't crunch.

**Fix:** re-save as a clean 32-bit PNG via `System.Drawing`, or better convert
the large full-screen art to **WebP** (also 10x smaller). Reference by resource
name (`R.drawable.x`) — extension doesn't matter, so no code changes needed.

---

## 16. `gradlew installDebug` fails on a locked phone

**Symptom:** `Can't open file: /data/local/tmp/app-debug.apk` /
`INSTALL_FAILED`.

**Cause:** Samsung blocks `/data/local/tmp` writes while the screen is locked.

**Fix:** install via streaming instead:
`adb install -r app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk`.

---

## 17. Skip button invisible on a colorful permission screen

**Fix:** give the secondary button real contrast — dark translucent fill
(`#CC101012`), 2dp gold stroke, gold bold text with a black shadow layer.
Don't rely on plain white text over a bright background.

